WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:02.141
Hi there!

2
00:00:02.161 --> 00:00:03.322
[s@Hi there!

3
00:00:03.342 --> 00:00:04.142
Who are you?

4
00:00:04.182 --> 00:00:06.444
I'm a giant anteater.

5
00:00:06.564 --> 00:00:18.272
Giant have very long tongues.

6
00:00:33.668 --> 00:00:34.729
Where do you live?

7
00:00:36.511 --> 00:00:40.795
Giant anteaters live in Central and South America.

8
00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:46.760
We like tropical forests and grasslands.

9
00:00:49.182 --> 00:00:51.444
Your tail has lots of hair!

10
00:00:51.464 --> 00:00:55.368
I use my tail as a blanket.

11
00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:59.272
I use it to block the sun too.

12
00:01:02.192 --> 00:01:04.134
You eat ants, right?

13
00:01:05.555 --> 00:01:09.217
Yes. We eat lots and lots of ants.

14
00:01:11.078 --> 00:01:12.980
We also eat termites.

15
00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.123
How do you find food?

16
00:01:19.144 --> 00:01:22.146
Giant anteaters have strong noses.

17
00:01:26.449 --> 00:01:30.072
We sniff for anthills and termite mounds.

18
00:01:31.728 --> 00:01:34.190
Then we dig up our food.

19
00:01:36.632 --> 00:01:38.813
Do you grab ants with your tongue?

20
00:01:40.094 --> 00:01:42.636
Our tongues are long and sticky.

21
00:01:44.457 --> 00:01:47.439
We flick our tongues into the anthill.

22
00:01:50.161 --> 00:01:52.082
Ants stick to our tongues.

23
00:01:54.284 --> 00:01:55.805
Do you have enemies?

24
00:01:57.366 --> 00:01:59.687
Pumas and jaguars hunt us.

25
00:02:01.748 --> 00:02:04.692
We fight them with our sharp claws.

26
00:02:08.196 --> 00:02:09.157
Sniff, sniff.

27
00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:13.161
I smell an anthill.

28
00:02:13.181 --> 00:02:14.323
Good-bye. Good-bye,
